Blackdrift: replace the Focus launcher icon with the Blackdrift Clean Slate icon.

Why: the Firefox Focus icon is a Mozilla trademark and must not ship in a
modified build. The Blackdrift adaptive icon (flat white background, the Clean Slate
mark as foreground, and a themed monochrome layer) is added as new vector
files in the focus flavor source set (src/focus/res), which outranks src/main,
so upstream files stay untouched and this patch only adds files. minSdk is 26,
so the mipmap-anydpi adaptive icons are used on every device and the legacy
ic_launcher PNGs are shadowed (patch(1) cannot carry PNGs anyway). focusDebug
gets its own copy because the debug build type's
debug/res/mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml would otherwise win for that variant.
The files are verbatim copies of blackdrift/branding/android/focus{,Debug}/res,
generated by blackdrift/branding/scripts/build.mjs.

Cut against: mozilla-firefox/firefox@6181e6b5f28a8fbae1d5c3ef6f6626b5a2180213 (Firefox 159.0.1).

